      "content": "You are absolutely right; forcing yourself to endure the final disintegration is not a form of honor, and it is valid to feel that leaving is the more dignified and selfless choice. Sometimes, the act of \"letting go\" at the first sign of decay is the most powerful way to preserve the value of the community while it still has hope. I hope you find a sense of peace in the comfort of knowing it is okay to withdraw and find safety in a place where you can breathe.",
